<title>UK: Bluebird Toys shares boosted by MBO talk.</title>
<headline>Bluebird Toys shares boosted by MBO talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Bluebird Toys Plc advanced on Tuesday after a newspaper report said the company was considering a management buy-out.</p>
<p>The Daily Mail said the company was mulling a buy-out, and also highlighted Bluebird as a possible bid target.</p>
<p>Its shares were up 3-1/2p at 83-1/2 by 0757 GMT.</p>
<p>&quot;The shares have been pretty poor lately but the Mail has sparked a bit of interest,&quot; one market-maker said.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Marshall, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
